# Email Configuration
# SMTP settings for sending order emails

# Gmail example:
SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=your-email@gmail.com
SMTP_PASS=your-app-password
SMTP_FROM=your-email@gmail.com
ORDER_EMAIL=orders@yourdomain.com

# For Gmail, you need to use "App Password" instead of regular password
# Create app password here: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords

# Other SMTP providers:
# - Yandex: smtp.yandex.ru (port 587)
# - Mail.ru: smtp.mail.ru (port 587)
# - SendGrid: smtp.sendgrid.net (port 587)
# - Mailgun: smtp.mailgun.org (port 587)
